{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Find, grab, and check object. If visible or in reach, move, take, and process. Scan area if necessary.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToTarget    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInReach    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    />",
